WEBVTT

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.750
Ahh, I'm so warm...

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.260
Get up, Aoi!

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.600
You can't sleep here!

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.510
We're supposed to be mountain girls!

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.900
I-I'm done for.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.380
Hinata, please go on...

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.350
...without me!

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.010
Okay!

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:21.620
Huh?

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.330
I'll make it to the summit 
and increase my girl power!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.800
Then I'll be the only one 
who gets really popular!

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.230
Mountaintop, here I come!

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.230
W-Wait, Hinata!

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.780
Don't leave!

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:36.200
We promised we'd climb the mountain 
of our memories together!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:38.740
Knitting

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.540
Brr! I left the air conditioner on.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:54.210
<i>I'm Yukimura Aoi, 
a first-year in high school.</i>

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.720
<i>I've usually had indoor hobbies...</i>

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:00.470
<i>...but I've started getting 
interested in mountaineering too.</i>

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.650
Wow, on Mount Fuji in wintertime?

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.650
That's right!

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:08.380
It was really cold of you to 
abandon me like that, Hinata!

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.480
And for popularity?!

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.980
Don't blame me for what 
happened in <i>your</i> dream!

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.230
Daytime events recur in dreams!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.360
All right, I get it.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.980
Still, the mountain of our memories...

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.500
That really takes me back!

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.620
C'mon, let's hurry and set up the tent!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.360
<i>This is Hinata, basically a childhood friend.</i>

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:31.270
<i>She's the one who got me into mountaineering.</i>

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:32.420
What?

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.380
Hmph! Nothing.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.130
Mountain Trail

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.130
Season 2 - New Climb 1

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.380
Season 2 - New Climb 1 
Let's Camp Overnight in a Tent!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.180
Can four people actually sleep in this tent?

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:43.650
It's compact when folded up,

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.960
but pretty big when spread out.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:46.520
There!

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:50.600
Now, we'll set it up.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.400
Will two of us be enough?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.310
More than enough!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:57.030
I'll hold it in place while you 
run the frame through the sleeve.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.490
"Frame through the sleeve?"

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.520
This is the "sleeve."

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:03.620
It's where you insert the frame 
that serves as the tent's skeleton.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:07.710
Like this?

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:08.790
Yeah, that's right!

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:11.750
And now, once more!

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:16.710
Now, stick the tip of the frame 
through the grommet!

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.460
You mean this?

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:23.550
It's in!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.130
Mine is too!

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.310
Then just one last part!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:30.140
Setting up a big tent is surprisingly simple.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.480
<i>If you're wondering why</i>

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.180
It really is big!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.940
<i>we're setting up a tent in Hinata's yard...</i>

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.940
Told ya!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.980
Camping in the mountains?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.410
I invited Kokona-chan and Kaede-san too,

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.110
so we'll camp overnight in a tent!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.450
Nice! That sounds fun!

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.590
Say, Mom...

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:50.090
What is it? Dinner isn't ready yet.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:53.480
I'm going to go camping with friends!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.420
Camping?

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:55.290
Yeah!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.680
We'll cook rice in a tin, 
pitch a tent, and—

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.090
No!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.020
A group of girls going camping by yourselves?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:04.590
I won't allow it!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.170
Oh, okay...

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:11.020
Well, is it all right if 
it's at Hinata's house?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.160
That way Hinata's father will be there too.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.400
Just don't impose on them.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.320
<i>And so, that's why we decided 
to camp out in Hinata's yard.</i>

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.320
Aoi, hammer the peg!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.570
Huh? A dog?

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.030
That's a "pug"!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.190
A "peg" is a stake.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.470
Look, they're over there.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.540
If you meant "stake," then say so!

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.760
Lean it a bit to the outside, 
then hammer in firmly.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.850
Hook the cord onto the peg,

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.920
and once they're all in place...

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.660
...it's ready!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.100
Looks like you got it set up correctly.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.780
Piece of cake!

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.230
You should be fine in that.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:58.810
It's so spacious!

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.350
I can stretch out my arms and legs!

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:01.330
Hello!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.320
Pardon the intrusion!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.540
Kokona-chan! Kaede-san!

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:05.530
Welcome!

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.030
<i>These two are mountain friends.</i>

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.130
Wow, it's a real tent!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.130
<i>Kaede-san is one grade ahead of me.</i>

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:14.080
<i>She's also my senior at mountain climbing.</i>

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.080
Did just the two of you assemble this?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.110
<i>The other girl, Kokona-chan, 
is in middle school.</i>

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.040
<i>She's the soothing type, 
with a lot of girl power.</i>

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.180
What a lovely house!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.940
I bought ingredients for dinner!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.980
Kaede-san, have you done this before?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.640
A few times.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.220
After washing the rice, cover with the lid 
and let it soak up the water for a bit.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.150
Since we're using a barbecue grill,

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:40.440
we can't do the usual,
 "Start with bubbling, boil midway."

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:42.170
What's that?

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:46.400
It's an old saying people used 
to describe how to cook rice.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.520
"Even if baby cries, lid must stay!"

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.540
When the lid starts floating up, 
set a weight on top.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.440
Now we wait until it stops boiling over.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.620
Tah-dah!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.700
Now I'll cook the curry!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.500
Right!

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:04.820
Spread out oil in a pot,

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.310
then stir-fry the onion 
until it begins to caramelize.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.320
Caramelize?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.800
After the onion, add potato...

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:12.550
carrots...

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.000
and meat, stir-frying each.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.970
Next, add water...

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:17.810
and bring to a boil!

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.410
After simmering a while, skim off the foam,

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.540
add the roux,

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.770
and it's done!

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.190
It smells great!

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.820
These are the secret ingredients.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.500
Chocolate and...

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.530
Coffee?

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.450
They will make it incredibly yummy!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.080
The rice is done too!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.960
Let's eat!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.700
The rice got a little burnt.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.130
But the burnt part is tasty!

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.720
The curry came out really well too.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.450
Yeah!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:53.100
But it doesn't taste like chocolate at all.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.140
If it did, then it wouldn't be a secret!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:57.350
We've got plenty of curry left.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.710
I'll have seconds!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.890
Me too!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.880
You use that much mayonnaise?

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.430
This isn't a lot, really.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.150
When mountain-climbing...

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.390
Okay, put those back where they belong.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:15.110
Huh, where's Hinata?

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:16.660
Huh?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:20.510
Our hearts skip a beat as we climb...

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:24.510
Come on, Hinata!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.890
You're the only one who 
didn't help with cleanup!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:28.620
Go use the bath, Aoi!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.340
It feels great!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.470
H-Hey, wait!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.180
It's fine, go ahead!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.140
Everyone else is waiting their turn!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:42.440
It's kinda hard to relax 
in someone else's bath...

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.310
I'm done!

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:51.280
It's been a long time since I've 
been able to stretch out in a bath!

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.740
That was a lovely bath!

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:57.200
Ahh, this is heaven...

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:58.660
Sorry I took so long.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.200
Kaede-san!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.140
You can't go around in that!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.870
Is something wrong, girls?

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:06.860
No! Dad, don't come in here!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.760
Kaede-san, put on some clothes!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.840
Oh, sorry about that, just force of habit.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.150
Aren't you cold, Kokona-chan?

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.090
I'm fine.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:20.380
I thought it was spacious, but it's 
pretty cramped with four people in here.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.680
Hinata, scooch over a little!

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:26.240
Mountain huts can be even more cramped.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.710
Really?

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.150
They can be pretty crowded 
in the high season.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.610
You get all packed in like on a full train!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:37.170
Can you sleep like that?

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.620
Everyone's so exhausted 
that we sleep soundly.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.070
I see...

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:44.930
After that, you make the hollandaise sauce.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.040
Use plenty of butter.

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.090
That sounds yummy!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.800
I'll try making Eggs Benedict too next time!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.760
Let's play syllable-chain!

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:56.460
But only with mountain names.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.040
That sounds hard.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.390
Okay, I'll start!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:00.980
Fuji-san!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.080
Oh, hold on.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.180
Strike that one!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.250
Let's see...

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.360
Takao-san!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.870
No, wait... Osore-zan!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.850
No, not that.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:11.820
Kilauea-kazan! What the?!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.890
It's gotten late into the night,

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.530
so it's love story time!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.860
Love story?

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.100
We've even got four girls here.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.220
You start, Aoi!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.490
Is there anyone you like?!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:23.820
No.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.130
You're kidding!

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:26.700
What about Yoneda-kun?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.670
That was just back in grade school.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.540
So, what about you, Hinata?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:32.650
Nope.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.510
You, Kaede-san?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:35.390
My choice would be...

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:36.260
Yeah, yeah!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.000
Mountains!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.340
Should've known.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:39.640
Kokona-chan?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.000
I, uh...

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:42.990
Who is it?!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.250
My heart pounds when Muuma-kun is near!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.350
Muuma-kun?

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.310
Who's that?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.600
Muuma

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.600
Muuma!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.040
He has a longish face,

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.270
and he's so fluffy...

00:09:53.530 --> 00:10:02.780
When the stars are falling, 
in a cold glissade,

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:11.500
Will my beloved come to me, 
with a rose in his teeth?

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:20.800
The love song of the Alps 
makes the heart skip a beat

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:31.060
For the nostalgic mountaineer, 
and for the one so sweet.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.780
Muuma!

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.640
Hang on, Hinata!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.850
I'll never abandon you!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.320
Keep going!

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.910
My tummy's nice and full...

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.400
Don't give up!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.260
We're almost to the summit!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.580
We'll be super-popular together!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.960
I couldn't eat another bite...

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.510
Geez, Hinata!

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.140
Now I'm wide awake.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:20.150
It's almost dawn...

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.030
You're up already?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:24.950
Hinata...

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:30.200
It's so pretty.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:30.850
Yeah.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.750
It reminds me...

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:36.750
...of the sunrise we saw as kids, 
from the mountain of memories.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.340
Would it be even prettier...

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.370
...seen from Mount Fuji?

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.340
Mount Fuji, huh?

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:52.370
<i>It was fun camping together 
overnight in a tent!</i>

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:56.460
<i>I hope we can visit a real 
mountain next time...</i>

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:59.400
To Be Continued!
